codex
The heading transform is correct: the detector explicitly negates the row component before computing θ. I found a pose-semantic error, though: vision publishes the intended rover rotation centre after configurable marker offsets; it only equals the marker centre while those offsets are zero. I’m tracing the depot and occlusion behavior next.
